+/* The suite's brand fonts (patch 070) — Fraunces display + Nunito Sans body, the same pairing
+   the apsconecta theme ships (MAPEO.md section 2), subset to the wizard's measured character
+   universe (Latin + es-CL accents + the punctuation the swept strings use) and instanced to
+   the weights the wizard actually sets: Fraunces as a static 600 for the h1-h3 display, Nunito
+   Sans keeping its weight axis for the 400-800 body range. Local files only — the wizard never
+   fetches a font from anywhere (the acquisition gate's install-time rule, applied to itself). */
+@font-face {
+    font-family: "Fraunces";
+    font-style: normal;
+    font-weight: 600;
+    font-display: swap;
+    src: url("fonts/Fraunces.woff2") format("woff2");
